# External cloned repo (re-fetchable via setup-manual.md instructions;
# has its own nested .git, no LICENSE to redistribute, and its renv library
# fills with large regenerable files once packages are installed).
# Ignore everything inside it except the renv lockfile, which IS our own
# reproducibility record.
paper-reproduction/central-amygdala-aud-atlas/paper-code/*
!paper-reproduction/central-amygdala-aud-atlas/paper-code/renv.lock